WEBVTT

00:00:28.092 --> 00:00:28.932
Oh yeah.

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:34.110
Young Master, Master is back.

00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:36.170
Did that Japanese girl come with you?

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:36.610
Yes.

00:00:36.830 --> 00:00:37.800
How does she look?

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:40.300
I can see it from afar.

00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:43.590
The top... the bottom...

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:45.440
Stop talking.

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:47.060
She has been ugly since she was little.

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:48.380
Isn't that right?

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:49.930
She's even uglier when she grows up.

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:50.510
That's right.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:00.740
Did you forget to pretend to be ill?

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:01.180
How?

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:04.340
Like that day, when my third uncle had a fever.

00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:04.980
I didn't have a fever.

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:07.700
Lie down first.

00:01:12.070 --> 00:01:12.980
What are you doing?

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:13.680
Come on.

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:15.070
Come on.

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:23.700
Old man, what are you doing?

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:27.410
Master, the young master has a fever.

00:01:27.890 --> 00:01:29.210
He needs to grab some hot tea.

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:34.230
Father, Third Brother is very angry.

00:01:34.410 --> 00:01:36.930
Why didn't you go to the doctor?

00:01:37.090 --> 00:01:39.640
I said I would go to the doctor, but A-Tao said no.

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:44.140
A-Tao, I came back in a hurry to do you a favor.

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:46.780
Why didn't you go to the doctor when you were sick?

00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:49.880
It's better to die than be forced to get married.

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:51.060
Nonsense.

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:53.280
Is it difficult to get married?

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:56.210
This marriage has been set up since childhood.

00:01:56.430 --> 00:01:59.720
This girl has been growing up with you since you were a child.

00:02:00.190 --> 00:02:01.450
What do you mean by forced marriage?

00:02:01.610 --> 00:02:03.610
I don't want to marry that Japanese girl who has a nosebleed.

00:02:03.630 --> 00:02:06.200
Hey, have you ever heard of a woman who has a nosebleed?

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:10.390
Your son is now a famous beauty in the capital.

00:02:11.210 --> 00:02:18.620
Your son's father has always had business with us.

00:02:18.620 --> 00:02:20.660
He has always supported our business.

00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:23.670
Besides, this marriage was already set up.

00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:24.770
People are coming.

00:02:25.030 --> 00:02:26.350
How can you not agree?

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:27.410
This is a business marriage.

00:02:27.590 --> 00:02:28.210
I will never agree.

00:02:28.590 --> 00:02:29.970
You, I'll give you a gift.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.840
You came back to study. Why are you getting more and more confused?

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:34.250
I'm not confused. I understand the reason.

00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:35.970
This is called forcing marriage.

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:36.730
You...

00:02:36.730 --> 00:02:38.470
Don't be angry.

00:02:38.650 --> 00:02:40.740
Tao, how can you...

00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:41.600
No need to talk to him.

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:43.040
Shut up and go to the doctor.

00:02:44.490 --> 00:02:45.250
Go now.

00:02:45.410 --> 00:02:45.590
Yes.

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:55.260
I hope you won't live here for too long.

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:58.150
Have a good rest today.

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:04.830
Young Master, Young Master, Young Master

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:05.610
Young Master, you...

00:03:05.610 --> 00:03:06.820
Come, come, come

00:03:06.820 --> 00:03:09.670
Tao, Tao

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:26.580
Dad, I forgot my Japanese

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:29.240
Long time no see, how are you?

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.540
How do you say it in Chinese?

00:03:36.640 --> 00:03:42.220
Hello, long time no see.

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:45.700
Mister, you speak Chinese so well.

00:03:46.590 --> 00:03:48.580
Dad, you taught him?

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:51.430
He learned it from your dad.

00:03:52.050 --> 00:03:55.290
Brother Tao, aren't you sick?

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:56.690
Have a good rest.

00:03:56.990 --> 00:03:59.030
I'm not sick.

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:02.460
Thank you.

00:04:47.110 --> 00:04:48.970
Why is the bride wearing such clothes?

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:51.610
Yes, why is she wearing white clothes?

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:53.470
It's not good for a bride to wear white clothes.

00:04:55.030 --> 00:04:57.770
Look, even the shoes are white.

00:04:58.250 --> 00:04:59.390
What's wrong with her?

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:07.750
Ready to worship

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:31.480
Why don't you kneel down?

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:33.920
I don't want to see you.

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:35.280
Why don't you understand?

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:36.340
Kneel down.

00:05:41.970 --> 00:05:44.730
Bridegroom, bridegroom,

00:05:44.850 --> 00:05:46.210
please raise your hands.

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:05.420
Turn around and say thank you to your friends

00:06:05.730 --> 00:06:28.490
Did you hear the sound of fighting or practicing?

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:29.640
I

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:30.600
Did you hear a fight?

00:06:30.920 --> 00:06:31.580
Who did you say fought?

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:35.500
Young Master, did Young Master practice martial arts this morning?

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:37.540
Practice martial arts? I don't think so.

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:39.390
He just got married a few days ago.

00:06:39.390 --> 00:06:40.830
How can he get up so early to practice martial arts?

00:06:41.010 --> 00:06:43.380
That's right. Young Master hit his wife.

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:44.640
Don't talk nonsense.

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:46.540
Did you see him hit his wife?

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:48.970
We didn't see it, but we heard it.

00:06:49.150 --> 00:06:52.710
He just got married a few days ago.

00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:54.500
He won't hit his wife.

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:56.220
Where did you hear it?

00:06:56.380 --> 00:06:56.990
In the backyard.

00:06:57.190 --> 00:06:59.900
The backyard? Let's go take a look.

00:07:16.180 --> 00:07:18.120
I'll go tell my father.

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:19.160
Let's go.

00:07:50.510 --> 00:07:53.460
Do you wake up early every morning to sleep with me?

00:07:53.620 --> 00:07:58.610
I wake up at six in the morning to do morning exercises.

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:00.650
Young Master.

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:04.990
Really?

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:10.700
I heard it myself.

00:08:12.040 --> 00:08:17.460
Dad, why don't you stay for a few more days?

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:20.350
The business in Japan needs someone to take care of it.

00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:20.960
Where's the young master?

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:23.940
He's come down.

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:28.430
Dad.

00:08:31.950 --> 00:08:37.710
Go back to Japan and say hello to my father for me.

00:08:37.710 --> 00:08:40.140
Tell him that I'm living a happy life here.

00:08:40.180 --> 00:08:45.140
My husband treats me very well.

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:53.080
Young Master, I didn't expect you to have such a good wife in my family.

00:08:53.080 --> 00:08:55.410
After I leave, you...

00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:56.610
Father, don't worry.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.610
You must love each other with all your heart and soul.

00:09:02.630 --> 00:09:05.330
If a husband bullies his wife,

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:07.660
that's the worst thing to do.

00:09:07.660 --> 00:09:15.260
Childe, if A-Tao bullies you,

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:16.680
send someone to tell me.

00:09:19.060 --> 00:09:21.390
Shou-guan, what are you doing in front of my father?

00:09:22.550 --> 00:09:22.890
Me?

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:26.120
You made me teach you a lesson.

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:27.300
No, no, Young Master.

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:27.900
Tell me.

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:28.480
I really didn't.

00:09:30.220 --> 00:09:34.020
You really want me to say it?

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:34.360
Tell me the truth!

00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:39.130
Young Master, you...

00:09:40.090 --> 00:09:42.090
You hit Young Mistress!

00:10:00.440 --> 00:10:00.620
Hey!

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:56.660
Are you okay?

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:00.950
What are you looking at?

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:02.250
Get lost.

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:03.310
Yes.

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:08.340
Have you finished your practice?

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:11.440
Yes, I have.

00:11:11.780 --> 00:11:18.480
Go upstairs and have a rest.

00:11:22.380 --> 00:11:24.340
Sorry, I didn't know that you don't know any kung fu.

00:11:24.860 --> 00:11:25.920
Does it hurt?

00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:28.820
You can tell that I don't know any kung fu?

00:11:30.030 --> 00:11:32.530
What kind of kung fu did you practice just now?

00:11:32.570 --> 00:11:33.850
I first practiced empty-handed.

00:11:34.050 --> 00:11:34.310
Eh?

00:11:34.550 --> 00:11:37.400
Later, the move you did was柔道.

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:37.720
Ah!

00:11:40.070 --> 00:11:44.890
What's wrong?

00:11:45.110 --> 00:11:46.110
It's so not like you.

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:47.000
Hmph.

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:49.860
Judo is a Japanese martial art.

00:11:49.920 --> 00:11:50.020
Oh?

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:53.370
Judo?

00:11:53.530 --> 00:11:54.370
I know.

00:11:54.590 --> 00:11:56.860
Your chest is so obvious.

00:11:57.260 --> 00:11:58.530
Isn't it hard to see?

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:01.540
This is for practicing kung fu.

00:12:01.720 --> 00:12:07.050
It's convenient to kick and punch.

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:09.660
If women kick and punch like this,

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:11.620
if people who like gambling see it,

00:12:11.720 --> 00:12:12.200
it will be strange if they don't lose.

00:12:14.140 --> 00:12:16.790
Isn't it the same for Chinese women to practice kung fu

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:18.350
and kick and punch?

00:12:19.370 --> 00:12:21.150
It's a little different.

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:24.200
But Chinese women practice kung fu

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:25.640
to be dignified and elegant.

00:12:25.980 --> 00:12:27.330
Other things are not mentioned.

00:12:27.410 --> 00:12:28.880
But for Zha Ma Bu,

00:12:30.350 --> 00:12:31.170
It should be like this

00:12:31.900 --> 00:12:42.630
Like this?

00:12:42.810 --> 00:12:44.000
Then how can I walk?

00:12:44.480 --> 00:12:49.150
This is the entry

00:12:49.150 --> 00:12:50.180
Now is the exit

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:55.550
This is called the two-syllable equinox

00:12:55.550 --> 00:12:57.390
How to kick the leg?

00:13:04.730 --> 00:13:10.230
Kick, kick again, kick again, kick again

00:13:10.230 --> 00:13:14.900
This is the group ring of Chinese women

00:13:14.900 --> 00:13:17.380
When you fight, you can't see

00:13:17.380 --> 00:13:20.520
You are polite and gentle

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:24.450
You are really gentle like a woman

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:26.660
But Japanese women

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:29.970
are not like that. When we fight, we are all like that

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:34.790
Did I hurt you?

00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:38.980
No, but when you practice kung fu,

00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:40.440
it's okay if you don't think about it.

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:43.240
But don't shout.

00:13:43.940 --> 00:13:44.280
Why?

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:48.070
If your family hears this,

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:49.330
they'll think I hit my wife.

00:14:01.596 --> 00:14:02.096
Ah!

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:34.920
This is the first time you've come to the martial arts school after you got married.

00:14:35.590 --> 00:14:39.120
Your kung fu has improved a lot, hasn't it?

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:41.800
Big Brother wouldn't be able to do that.

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:44.010
If you practice kung fu every day,

00:14:44.010 --> 00:14:47.010
your kung fu will definitely improve a lot.

00:14:48.850 --> 00:14:49.900
What are you saying?

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.220
What am I saying?

00:14:51.340 --> 00:14:54.370
I'm saying that your wife in Japan is very good at martial arts.

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:57.500
If someone sees that your wife falls lightly,

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:58.460
they will...

00:14:58.460 --> 00:14:58.880
Stop!

00:15:01.240 --> 00:15:09.100
Who said so? Don't talk nonsense

00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:10.170
I'm not talking nonsense

00:15:10.170 --> 00:15:14.620
His wife kicked him out

00:15:14.620 --> 00:15:15.760
He saw it with his own eyes

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:16.490
He was so confident

00:15:16.490 --> 00:15:19.160
He didn't win a single coin in a month

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:21.740
You...

00:15:26.470 --> 00:15:28.690
Young Master, please spare me

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:29.970
I'm not talking nonsense

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:31.780
It's said that they are from a wealthy family.

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:33.360
It's none of my business.

00:15:33.860 --> 00:15:35.630
If you don't tell them, how will they know?

00:15:36.070 --> 00:15:38.830
My lord, your wife is yours.

00:15:39.170 --> 00:15:40.690
Only you know about your wife.

00:15:41.110 --> 00:15:41.610
You...

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:43.670
How would I know about your wife?

00:15:44.530 --> 00:15:45.190
This...

00:15:45.190 --> 00:15:45.650
Hello.

00:15:46.010 --> 00:15:47.930
My lord, please spare me.

00:15:48.030 --> 00:15:48.810
Don't hit me.

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:50.190
My lord, bad news.

00:15:50.370 --> 00:15:52.260
Hou Yue'er has fallen down.

00:15:52.640 --> 00:15:52.960
What?

00:15:55.090 --> 00:15:56.590
Hou Yue'er.

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:15.280
Hey, what are you doing?

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:17.000
I'm practicing kung fu

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:17.320
Stop!

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:19.820
Practicing kung fu?

00:16:19.860 --> 00:16:21.920
There's no reason to knock down the wall

00:16:21.920 --> 00:16:22.680
and break the stone tower

00:16:23.180 --> 00:16:23.520
Yay!

00:16:26.600 --> 00:16:27.720
No sandbags

00:16:30.410 --> 00:16:30.910
Do you have a wooden board?

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:33.420
How do I practice?

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:36.340
I'm going to kick the wall again.

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:43.250
One, two, three, four, five, six.

00:16:45.050 --> 00:16:46.860
Young Mistress, practicing like you

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:48.900
won't last more than half a year.

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:50.670
The whole house will be torn down.

00:16:51.140 --> 00:16:51.780
Cut the crap.

00:16:51.880 --> 00:16:53.310
Chief, go find someone to repair it.

00:16:53.430 --> 00:16:54.230
Yes, yes.

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:55.920
Let's go.

00:16:56.060 --> 00:16:58.180
Young Master, from now on,

00:16:58.200 --> 00:16:59.260
I won't allow you to practice kung fu.

00:17:00.190 --> 00:17:00.350
Why?

00:17:00.690 --> 00:17:07.800
Young Master, if you want to learn kung fu,

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:09.640
why don't I teach you Chinese martial arts?

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:12.060
Chinese martial arts?

00:17:12.450 --> 00:17:12.810
Yes.

00:17:12.950 --> 00:17:15.330
Because the kung fu that Chinese women practice

00:17:15.330 --> 00:17:17.230
is more personal.

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:18.640
It's not that rough.

00:17:18.860 --> 00:17:21.180
I'm not a Chinese woman.

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:22.630
Your husband is Chinese.

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:24.630
You should also learn Chinese martial arts.

00:17:24.820 --> 00:17:25.780
Your wife is Japanese.

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:27.800
Why don't you learn Japanese kung fu?

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:28.440
You...

00:17:31.310 --> 00:17:32.470
You kick one wall a day

00:17:32.470 --> 00:17:34.450
If you kick like this every day

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:36.450
Then we don't even have a place to sleep

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:42.390
Don't practice boxing

00:17:42.390 --> 00:17:43.760
Practice something else, okay?

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:45.370
Don't worry

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:47.880
The equipment for my practice has almost been shipped

00:17:48.320 --> 00:17:48.900
What equipment

00:17:50.140 --> 00:17:57.700
It's not fake fire

00:17:58.070 --> 00:17:59.380
Fake fire

00:18:00.440 --> 00:18:00.800
There's still a knife.

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:02.010
What are you talking about?

00:18:02.350 --> 00:18:07.140
Young Master, these weapons...

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:09.490
These are the weapons I asked someone to bring from Japan.

00:18:10.630 --> 00:18:10.890
Sword.

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:36.960
Oh my god

00:18:45.860 --> 00:18:48.560
Young master, look at this

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:50.260
Not bad

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:06.710
This is called XI

00:19:06.710 --> 00:19:11.060
And then

00:19:11.060 --> 00:19:23.420
QIANG

00:19:33.210 --> 00:19:48.480
To those who want to run

00:19:48.840 --> 00:19:54.160
Young Master, stop fooling around

00:19:54.160 --> 00:19:54.970
There's a lot

00:20:06.620 --> 00:20:10.510
Lao Tao, you like to dance. Why don't you let your sister-in-law do it?

00:20:10.650 --> 00:20:14.860
I don't know. She...

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:17.220
She can compete with you?

00:20:17.340 --> 00:20:20.200
No, she practices all the Dongyang Kungfu.

00:20:20.830 --> 00:20:21.890
My family doesn't have a place for her to practice.

00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:23.930
Yes, we do.

00:20:24.090 --> 00:20:25.840
Don't you have a dance hall at home?

00:20:25.940 --> 00:20:28.850
The young master is very strong.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.080
I'm afraid he doesn't like our Chinese martial arts hall.

00:20:32.100 --> 00:20:34.170
Young Master, it's bad.

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:37.910
Young Mistress has moved her weapons into your martial arts hall.

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:40.510
That's good. Let her practice in the martial arts hall.

00:20:41.510 --> 00:20:44.070
No, she has moved all your Chinese weapons out.

00:20:46.010 --> 00:20:48.320
Hurry up and move them out.

00:20:49.200 --> 00:20:54.440
What are you doing?

00:20:54.760 --> 00:20:56.990
It's not our business. It's Young Mistress's.

00:20:58.420 --> 00:20:58.860
Move them all back.

00:21:00.510 --> 00:21:01.680
Come on, move it out quickly.

00:21:02.180 --> 00:21:03.090
Come on, come on.

00:21:03.110 --> 00:21:03.900
And these.

00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:04.920
Move them all out.

00:21:05.120 --> 00:21:06.250
Hurry up.

00:21:06.250 --> 00:21:06.510
Stop.

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:09.420
A Tao.

00:21:09.560 --> 00:21:15.190
